      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "What this axis is, and what it deliberately is not",
      "prov:value": "The owner's ruling on bean `rkqp` sets the boundary: **an agentic review, with no\nformal gate on rule content.** \"Best practice\" drifts, and a vendor describing\nits own product is an assertion, not evidence.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean rkqp"
      ]
    },
    {
      "@id": "skills/kg/kg-core/skill-voice-review.md#provenance-2",
      "@type": "prov:Entity",
      "cat-harness:provenanceKind": "bean",
      "cat-harness:section": "Reviewing one skill against one voice",
      "prov:value": "A voice\n   review is a judgement, so it is kept as `voice_reviews` in the skill's\n   attestation file, `<instance>/test/attestations/kg-qa/<skill path>.attestations.json`\n   (`qa-attestations/v1`), on `main` — not in the derived kg-qa sidecar, whose\n   record moves to the `qa-reports` branch (bean `2gst`, arc `3fva`). Commit\n   the attestation file.",
      "cat-harness:refs": [
        "bean 2gst",
        "`3fva`"
      ]
    }
  ]
